        <inputParameters>
            <name>query</name>
            <value>
                <inputConfiguratorMode>Resource</inputConfiguratorMode>
                <stringValue>You are filing a document that arrived for an equipment finance deal. Decide which ONE of these it is. APPLICATION: a finance or credit application form completed by the borrower. INVOICE: a supplier invoice or bill of sale for equipment, including a sales invoice or a tax invoice. IDENTITY: a driving licence or driver license, a passport or an ID card, or a utility bill such as electricity, gas, water or telephone used as proof of address. AGREEMENT: an equipment finance agreement, loan agreement or lease agreement, signed or unsigned. OTHER: anything else, including a photograph of equipment, a delivery note or a letter. Answer with exactly one word from APPLICATION, INVOICE, IDENTITY, AGREEMENT, OTHER and nothing else.</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputParameters>
        <nameSegment>cldfs__QueryDocument</nameSegment>
        <offset>0</offset>
